{"1817030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Swordcery", "steam_appid": 1817030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4747730], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/306fb485289df0313b26dd830c451642.avif?t=1786467631\" width=780 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/4a942a29c76ee788c6fceb54b62833b2.poster.avif?t=1786467631\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/4a942a29c76ee788c6fceb54b62833b2.webm?t=1786467631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/4a942a29c76ee788c6fceb54b62833b2.mp4?t=1786467631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your mettle (but also your metal) as you <strong>discover and unleash the power behind a multitude of magical swords to defeat an otherworldly Celestial evil!</strong> Your quest will challenge your reactions, lead you through treacherous biomes, and pit you against the most formidable enemies and bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/77e52ec6189da8956559dfc0885e99d6.avif?t=1786467631\" width=780 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/ef8f4df5f49dc6f3bf0b399c2b4be20e.poster.avif?t=1786467631\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/ef8f4df5f49dc6f3bf0b399c2b4be20e.webm?t=1786467631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/ef8f4df5f49dc6f3bf0b399c2b4be20e.mp4?t=1786467631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A giant blade has plunged into the world of Armorial, bringing a hail of smaller blades along with it.</strong> The calamitous sword seems to be draining the power of the planet itself, and with each passing day, the rain of swords grows heavier and heavier. To undo this vile corruption, you’ll <strong>play as Colt, an unwitting hero who has gained the ability to wield the fallen blades.</strong> It's time to make a stand against the Celestial evil that seeks to destroy the kingdom!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/6ef89cb7f6ccac5db14511fbe9902bbe.avif?t=1786467631\" width=780 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/fa3609d2dc9a9663ab88014203649b69.poster.avif?t=1786467631\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/fa3609d2dc9a9663ab88014203649b69.webm?t=1786467631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/fa3609d2dc9a9663ab88014203649b69.mp4?t=1786467631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you venture forth, each new sword you find will come with a unique ability, aka its Swordcery.</strong> These abilities allow you to perform magical feats like: hurling your sword out in boomerang-like fashion, thundering down as a bolt of lightning, opening up hellfire fissures, or summoning a ring of protective icy swordflakes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/5678266f4e131fa5ab8d35499dfa31d2.avif?t=1786467631\" width=780 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every blade you find is categorized into a Sword Class, which has its own set of offensive maneuvers.</strong> From specific combos to unique abilities, each Sword Class may be more advantageous due to the terrain or combat situation. It is up to you to master and acknowledge which Sword Class's attributes and attacks will work in unison along with your mighty Swordcery abilities. Enemy encounters will test your ability to recognize patterns, reactions to telegraphed attacks, your ability to utilize both melee and various magical attacks, as well as your resource management skills while in the heat of battle. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/98a9c536891a9a9e236cd73eda7bd3fd.avif?t=1786467631\" width=780 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new run, you can expect to discover new swords, find various relics to add to your playstyle, choose new sword class upgrades, and trek through procedurally generated dungeons.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/306fb485289df0313b26dd830c451642.avif?t=1786467631\" width=780 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/4a942a29c76ee788c6fceb54b62833b2.poster.avif?t=1786467631\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/4a942a29c76ee788c6fceb54b62833b2.webm?t=1786467631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/4a942a29c76ee788c6fceb54b62833b2.mp4?t=1786467631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your mettle (but also your metal) as you <strong>discover and unleash the power behind a multitude of magical swords to defeat an otherworldly Celestial evil!</strong> Your quest will challenge your reactions, lead you through treacherous biomes, and pit you against the most formidable enemies and bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/77e52ec6189da8956559dfc0885e99d6.avif?t=1786467631\" width=780 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/ef8f4df5f49dc6f3bf0b399c2b4be20e.poster.avif?t=1786467631\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/ef8f4df5f49dc6f3bf0b399c2b4be20e.webm?t=1786467631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/ef8f4df5f49dc6f3bf0b399c2b4be20e.mp4?t=1786467631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A giant blade has plunged into the world of Armorial, bringing a hail of smaller blades along with it.</strong> The calamitous sword seems to be draining the power of the planet itself, and with each passing day, the rain of swords grows heavier and heavier. To undo this vile corruption, you’ll <strong>play as Colt, an unwitting hero who has gained the ability to wield the fallen blades.</strong> It's time to make a stand against the Celestial evil that seeks to destroy the kingdom!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/6ef89cb7f6ccac5db14511fbe9902bbe.avif?t=1786467631\" width=780 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/fa3609d2dc9a9663ab88014203649b69.poster.avif?t=1786467631\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/fa3609d2dc9a9663ab88014203649b69.webm?t=1786467631\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/fa3609d2dc9a9663ab88014203649b69.mp4?t=1786467631\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you venture forth, each new sword you find will come with a unique ability, aka its Swordcery.</strong> These abilities allow you to perform magical feats like: hurling your sword out in boomerang-like fashion, thundering down as a bolt of lightning, opening up hellfire fissures, or summoning a ring of protective icy swordflakes!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/5678266f4e131fa5ab8d35499dfa31d2.avif?t=1786467631\" width=780 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every blade you find is categorized into a Sword Class, which has its own set of offensive maneuvers.</strong> From specific combos to unique abilities, each Sword Class may be more advantageous due to the terrain or combat situation. It is up to you to master and acknowledge which Sword Class's attributes and attacks will work in unison along with your mighty Swordcery abilities. Enemy encounters will test your ability to recognize patterns, reactions to telegraphed attacks, your ability to utilize both melee and various magical attacks, as well as your resource management skills while in the heat of battle. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/extras/98a9c536891a9a9e236cd73eda7bd3fd.avif?t=1786467631\" width=780 height=109 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new run, you can expect to discover new swords, find various relics to add to your playstyle, choose new sword class upgrades, and trek through procedurally generated dungeons.</p>", "short_description": "A colossal blade has pierced the world of Armorial, unleashing a storm of enchanted swords from the heavens. Collect and wield an arsenal of these spellbound blades, turning them against the very force that summoned them. In this roguelike ARPG, you will defy the Celestial evil consuming the world!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/1c8c8e96be66109d0b37e9b99c520c8da6b81875/header.jpg?t=1786467631", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/d628024f8bf21bd24d11078a6ac52ad135d18360/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786467631", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1817030/d628024f8bf21bd24d11078a6ac52ad135d18360/cap